[ALERT] Payment declined
======================================================

Amount:        <%= @amount_formatted %>
Buyer:         <%= @sender ? "#{@sender.name} (##{@sender.id}, #{@sender.email})" : "unknown" %>
Merchant:      <%= @merchant ? "#{@merchant.store_name} (##{@merchant.id})" : "unknown" %>
Error code:    <%= @error_code %>
Decline code:  <%= @decline_code || "—" %>

A buyer tried to purchase a gift card and their payment was declined.
No money moved and no card was created — this is a lost sale, sent for
visibility. At most one alert per payment per day.

Review in Stripe: https://dashboard.stripe.com/payments/<%= @payment_intent_id %>
